abstract: >-
  A sanitized enterprise case study of Microsoft 365 protection using a
  four-node primary backup cluster, controlled Windows recovery staging,
  NetBackup MSDP, and LTO-9 long-term retention. The report emphasizes
  application-level recovery validation and end-to-end copy-chain evidence.
